<title>USA: TABLE - Rock-Tenn Co Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Rock-Tenn Co Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.18		    $0.40</p>
<p> Net			  6,212		   13,525</p>
<p> Total net sales	300,302		  216,211</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,085		   34,121</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $1.10</p>
<p> Net			  6,420		   37,577</p>
<p> Total net sales	784,017		  652,050</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,102		   34,007</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 quarter net income reduced by $0.05 per share because of employee severance charges related to closing of the Mundelein, Ill. folding carton operation and charges associated with the decision to dispose of a plastics recycling facility.</p>
<p>The company's income from operations was $19.5 million compared to $24.1 million.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
